<section class="ferramenta">
  <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/ferramentas">Ferramentas</a></li>
      <li>{{.Title}}</li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
  <h2>{{.Title}}</h2>
  <p>{{.Description}}</p>
  <div class="grid ip-grid">
    <article class="ip-box" data-ip-lookup="https://api.ipify.org?format=json">
      <small>IPv4</small>
      <output class="ip" id="ipv4">{{if eq .Version "IPv4"}}{{.IP}}{{else}}Buscando…{{end}}</output>
      <button type="button" class="secondary outline" data-copy="#ipv4">Copiar</button>
    </article>
    <article class="ip-box" data-ip-lookup="https://api6.ipify.org?format=json">
      <small>IPv6</small>
      <output class="ip" id="ipv6">{{if eq .Version "IPv6"}}{{.IP}}{{else}}Buscando…{{end}}</output>
      <button type="button" class="secondary outline" data-copy="#ipv6">Copiar</button>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p><small>O servidor viu a sua conexão pelo {{.Version}} <code>{{.IP}}</code>. O outro endereço é consultado pelo seu navegador no <a href="https://www.ipify.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ipify</a>. Se você usa VPN ou proxy, aparecem os IPs deles.</small></p>
</section>
